cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Activities and Potentials Calculation Pipeline"
abstract: >
  An open-source pipeline that derives building-level activity types and potentials
  for agent-based travel demand models. It combines ALKIS / LoD2 cadastral buildings
  and OpenStreetMap, classifies every building's activities (MiD labels) and
  Bosserhof workplace class with a large language model or, alternatively, a
  deterministic rule engine, and redistributes zone-level activity totals to the
  buildings and their occupants by occupied floor area.
